    "DoclingQueryParams": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "docling-serve conversion options. Every field defaults to None and is only sent when set\nin backend_config.toml: the request carries exactly what the config declares, docling-serve's\nown defaults apply to the rest. Presets must exist on the docling-serve side (its config).",
